      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can the emulator backend API be abstracted to higher level operations?\n\nSomething like:\n```\nemul_pdc_connect_charger(*emul, *pdo_list);\nemul_pdc_connect_sink(*emul, *snk_pdo);\nemul_pdc_connect_drp_partner(*emul, *pdo_list, *drp_properties)\nemul_pdc_disconnect_partner(*emul);\n```\n\nThis should make the test flow easier to write and follow.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "e91db55f623a8f7d1cdcd8b0ffe291f57b21cccc",
