      "writtenOn": "2024-01-10T15:15:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can add these in addition to what I currently have. What I have here  matches the request/responses defined in realtek\u0027s data sheet and will help validate the driver\u0027s massaging of realtek\u0027s data format into UCSI format.",
