      "message": "So as far as I\u0027m concerned this is a good backend for that goal. I\u0027m going to give my +1 but defer to Keith if we want backend emulator APIs to be more driven by abstract scenarios as he mentioned above.\n\nAs an aside, we can always abstract it more later.",
